Description: Yarp, the Taskforce terminal for developers and teams
 Yarp is a modern, Rust-based terminal with a built-in Taskforce so teams can
 coordinate code work faster. Bringing a futuristic police-station workflow to
 the command line, Yarp lets teams dispatch officers, keep case files, and share
 command-room context for onboarding and incident response.
